         border-bottom: 1px dotted #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-size: 10pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:hover {\n            color: #ff6600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #828282;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            margin-top: 5px;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .empty-section {\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: #828282;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 10px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            color: #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .source-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #828282;\n            padding: 1px 4px;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .product-name {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #ff6600;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                border: 1px solid #000000;\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n\n            .three-column-layout {\n                display: block;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                margin-bottom: 20px;\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"date\">2026-05-07</div>\n        </header>\n\n        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Section -->\n            <section class=\"column new-products\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">New Products</div>\n                <div class=\"empty-section\">\n                    No new products reported for this period.\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"column whitelist-updates\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">Whitelist Updates</div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"product-name\">Claude Code</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Release</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Version 2.1.132 released with multiple bug fixes and improvements including session ID environment variable, alternate screen opt-out, improved SIGINT handling, terminal fixes for various IDEs (Cursor, VS Code, JetBrains), and MCP server error handling improvements.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-06</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.132\">View Release →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"product-name\">Cursor</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Feature</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Context Usage Breakdown feature introduced in Cursor 3.3, allowing developers to see detailed stats about their agent's context consumption across rules, skills, MCPs, and subagents to diagnose issues and optimize setup.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-06</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog/05-06-26\">View Details →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"product-name\">GitHub Copilot</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Announcement</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Enterprise-Managed Plugins now in public preview for GitHub Copilot CLI, allowing organizations to control and manage CLI plugin access and configuration for their teams.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-06</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-05-06-enterprise-managed-plugins-in-github-copilot-cli-are-now-in-public-preview\">View Details →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"product-name\">Windsurf</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Release</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Version 2.2.17 released with Devin Review and Quick Review now available to all users, Agent Command Center improvements with list display, better session sorting/filtering, and Windows update bug fixes.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-06</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://codeium.com/changelog\">View Release →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"product-name\">Cursor</span>\n                        <span class=\"update-type\">Feature</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Enterprise admin updates including granular model access controls at provider/model level, updated spend management, and enhanced usage analytics with option to block new providers by default.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-04</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog/05-04-26\">View Details →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"column technical-insights\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">Technical Insights</div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2011954028528038812\">AI Programming Enters the 'Intelligent Agent Engineering' Era</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI systems can now autonomously complete the entire software development lifecycle. Multi-agent collaboration compresses development timelines by 70%.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">AI Industry Analysis</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-01</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">automation</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2011954028528038812\">2026 AI Coding Tools Complete Guide: Five Major Categories</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Comprehensive guide covering IDEs with integrated AI, programming assistants, application builders, extensions and agents, code review and security tools, and documentation tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Zhihu Tech Column</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-01</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding tools</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">IDE</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.hubwiz.com/blog\">Google's 2026 Full AI Integration Initiative</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Google engineering lead announces 2026 will see full AI integration across the entire programming workflow, emphasizing classic software engineering discipline remains important.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Google Engineering</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Google</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.hubwiz.com/blog\">Natural Language Programming Becomes Viable in 2026</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Programming barriers are being lowered as natural language becomes viable for software creation, marking shift from specification-driven to AI agent-driven development.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Industry Analysts</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-03</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">NLP</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">accessibility</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2011954028528038812\">AI Programming Platform 2.0 Launches with Multi-Agent Collaboration</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Major platforms launching 2.0 versions with multi-agent collaboration systems, improving complex problem-solving accuracy by 30%. Cursor leads with deep AI integration.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Platform Updates</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-04</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Cursor</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">multi-agent</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.hubwiz.com/blog\">Market Validation: AI Coding Tools Entering High Growth Period</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Overseas markets validate AI coding tools value. Domestic markets entering high growth with intense competition. CTOs focus shifts from 'completion speed' to 'engineering capability ceiling'.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Market Analysis</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-05</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">market trends</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">enterprise</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.hubwiz.com/blog\">AI Will Not Replace Programmers But Augment Their Capabilities</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Industry consensus emphasizes AI will augment rather than replace programmers. Developers advised to focus on working effectively with AI agents while maintaining software engineering principles.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Industry Experts</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-06</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI augmentation</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">future of work</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\">MongoDB.local London 2026: Moving AI from Prototype to Production</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Event focuses on helping teams move AI from prototype to production, reflecting industry shift from experimental AI to production-ready AI systems.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">MongoDB</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">2026-05-07</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">MongoDB</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI production</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>\n                <a href=\"#\">Archives</a> |\n                <a href=\"#\">About</a> |\n                <a href=\"#\">Subscribe</a> |\n                Generated with Claude Code\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 8pt;\">\n                © 2026 Agentic Coding Research Report\n            </p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"